      "title": "Why",
      "items": [
        "The list is read on the settled path, so Allow has to add one",
        "A trailing slash means the folder; a refusal for /foo/ ends in one, so the intent now travels with the click",
        "Forty spellings of one path can no longer push forty real refusals out"
